TI  - Effects of Escherichia coli Nissle 1917 and Ciprofloxacin on small intestinal epithelial cell mRNA expression in the neonatal piglet model of human rotavirus infection
AU  - F. Paim
AU  - S. Langel
AU  - David D Fischer
AU  - S. Kandasamy
