DO  - 10.1128/mra.00392-21
AN  - 33986102
AB  - We report the whole-genome sequence of a promising human probiotic, Bacillus coagulans BC01, isolated from thick broad-bean sauce. B. coagulans BC01 is widely used in China, where it is considered a treatment for diarrhea, constipation, and allergies and an immunity booster. The complete genome sequence of B. coagulans BC01 will help future research to provide more molecular information about its features and safety. ABSTRACT We report the whole-genome sequence of a promising human probiotic, Bacillus coagulans BC01, isolated from thick broad bean sauce. B. coagulans BC01 is widely used in China, where it is considered a treatment for diarrhea, constipation, and allergies and an immunity booster. The complete genome sequence of B. coagulans BC01 will help future research to provide more molecular information about its features and safety.
